to sell?

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.020
So it's called a round trip.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:54.960
You pay 10 to put the position on and you
pay 10 to take it off.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:57.600
What happens?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:04.460
